   "y": 470,
   "text": "WITHOUT THE CONNECTION",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b17",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 498,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 86,
   "backgroundColor": "#fbe0e0",
   "strokeColor": "#b42318",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "Paint yourself into a corner,\nor overbuild",
    "fontSize": 17,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#7a1a12"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b18",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 498,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 86,
   "backgroundColor": "#fbe0e0",
   "strokeColor": "#b42318",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "Solve a problem compelling to one person:\nit works perfectly and serves nobody",
    "fontSize": 17,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#7a1a12"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b19",
   "x": 1050,
   "y": 215,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 300,
   "backgroundColor": "#1f1b17",
   "strokeColor": "#4a3f35",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t20",
   "x": 1072,
   "y": 233,
   "text": "#1244 · Dodds · 00:21:34",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#fdba74"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t21",
   "x": 1072,
   "y": 265,
   "text": "\"connect [...] what the customer\n needs to the technical choices\n that are being made so that you\n don't paint yourself into a\n corner and you don't overbuild.\"",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#f5ede4"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t22",
   "x": 1072,
   "y": 401,
   "text": "#1245 · Dodds · 00:11:30",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#fdba74"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t23",
   "x": 1072,
   "y": 433,
   "text": "the job statement \"helps a lot\n with making sure you're\n building the right thing.\"",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#f5ede4"
  },
  {
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "b24",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 630,
   "width": 600,
